stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Ingest
  Ingest --> Normalize: raw text
  Normalize --> Classify: clean text
  Classify --> Threshold: class scores
  Threshold --> AutoRoute: above cutoff
  Threshold --> HumanReview: below cutoff
  HumanReview --> Labeled: operator decision
  AutoRoute --> Retrain: feedback
  Labeled --> Retrain: feedback
  Retrain --> Classify: updated model
